{title: Ye Jo Mohabbat Hai}
{artist: Kishore Kumar Rd R D Burman}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
[Em]Yeh jo mohabbat hai [D]yeh unaka hain kam
[Em]Mehboob kaa jo [D]bas lete huye nam
[Am]Mar jaye [G]mit jaye [D]ho jaye badanam
[Em]Rehne [C]do chhodo [G]bhi jane [D]do yar,
[D]hum [G]na [Em]karenge pyar....
[Em]Tute agar [D]sagar naya sagar [Am]koyi le le
[D]Mere khuda dil [C]se koyi kisike [Em]ke na khele
[D]Dil [G]tut jaye [Am]toh kya [Em]ho anjam
[Em]Aankhe kisi se [D]naa ulajh jaye [Am]mai darta hu
[D]Yaro hasino [C]ki gali se [Em]mai guzarta hu
[D]Bas [G]dur hi [Am]se kar [Em]ke salam
